{"4134470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doll's House", "steam_appid": 4134470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Doll’s House</i>, you return to your childhood home, navigating narrow hallways, dim rooms, and locked attics while uncovering the story and surviving relentless chases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five distinct doll chases</strong><br>Each doll enters and pursues differently. You’ll need to observe, adapt, and react if you hope to escape them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/0490cb56b1b048dde962e5c53ddfc566.avif?t=1765962628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/0490cb56b1b048dde962e5c53ddfc566.avif?t=1765962628 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Giant board-like maze areas</strong><br>Some stages throw you into a chessboard-like space, letting you glimpse the past as you search for an exit within limited visibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/8b4ef01652b110667991b21f9e9dc8fe.avif?t=1765962628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/8b4ef01652b110667991b21f9e9dc8fe.avif?t=1765962628 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A camera that reveals fragments of the past</strong><br>Use the camera to capture how the house once looked, uncover hidden traces, and slowly piece together the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/8e17e0cb3340fe89923f2832f88bc050.avif?t=1765962628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/8e17e0cb3340fe89923f2832f88bc050.avif?t=1765962628 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reassembling scattered dolls and memory fragments</strong><br>Broken dolls and objects are scattered throughout the house. Rebuild them to unlock clues and reveal parts of the family’s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/3f44675c32ab481733d2a865fe542261.avif?t=1765962628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/3f44675c32ab481733d2a865fe542261.avif?t=1765962628 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puppet shows that reenact the past</strong><br>In certain places, puppets replay past events like a miniature theater, giving you a new perspective on the house’s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/fe3be355e294e0d09756ebb1a7f58d17.avif?t=1765962628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/fe3be355e294e0d09756ebb1a7f58d17.avif?t=1765962628 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Doll’s House</i> blends psychological horror, narrative exploration, and chase-based gameplay.<br>And the house hides far more—many mechanics and discoveries await you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Doll’s House</i>, you return to your childhood home, navigating narrow hallways, dim rooms, and locked attics while uncovering the story and surviving relentless chases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five distinct doll chases</strong><br>Each doll enters and pursues differently. You’ll need to observe, adapt, and react if you hope to escape them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/0490cb56b1b048dde962e5c53ddfc566.avif?t=1765962628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/0490cb56b1b048dde962e5c53ddfc566.avif?t=1765962628 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Giant board-like maze areas</strong><br>Some stages throw you into a chessboard-like space, letting you glimpse the past as you search for an exit within limited visibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/8b4ef01652b110667991b21f9e9dc8fe.avif?t=1765962628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/8b4ef01652b110667991b21f9e9dc8fe.avif?t=1765962628 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A camera that reveals fragments of the past</strong><br>Use the camera to capture how the house once looked, uncover hidden traces, and slowly piece together the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/8e17e0cb3340fe89923f2832f88bc050.avif?t=1765962628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/8e17e0cb3340fe89923f2832f88bc050.avif?t=1765962628 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reassembling scattered dolls and memory fragments</strong><br>Broken dolls and objects are scattered throughout the house. Rebuild them to unlock clues and reveal parts of the family’s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/3f44675c32ab481733d2a865fe542261.avif?t=1765962628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/3f44675c32ab481733d2a865fe542261.avif?t=1765962628 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puppet shows that reenact the past</strong><br>In certain places, puppets replay past events like a miniature theater, giving you a new perspective on the house’s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras/fe3be355e294e0d09756ebb1a7f58d17.avif?t=1765962628\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/extras_big/fe3be355e294e0d09756ebb1a7f58d17.avif?t=1765962628 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Doll’s House</i> blends psychological horror, narrative exploration, and chase-based gameplay.<br>And the house hides far more—many mechanics and discoveries await you.</p>", "short_description": "Doll’s House is a horror game mixing psychological tension, narrative exploration, and intense chase encounters.Explore clues inside a shifting house while being hunted by dolls with unique personalities and mechanics.Each chase ties into the story, and how you survive shapes your view of the family", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/41c71ed71c83ea79a82edb89105fad2a85689bf5/header.jpg?t=1765962628", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134470/5746f5dc4fdeae0eda6b76e4b2f7cd22e797fdbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765962628", "capsule_imagev5": "ht